  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Transformation for schools in Burundi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is to facilitate    the digital transformation for Burundi&apos;s education system, It will equip fifteen schools with ICT Labs with 300 computers connected to Internet for students to learn ICT ,digital entrepreneurship    and research. The project will also train 300 teachers, who will instruct the ICT curriculum for 18,000 students from those schools. It will prepare Burundian youth for the ability to compete in the global economy with needed skills for Innovations and job market</narrative>
  </description>
